    "created_at": "2018-04-26T21:03:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-26T21:03:06Z",
    "body": "> @mkruisselbrink can you estimate when that use counter will hit stable, so we can set a calendar reminder to revisit this when it does?\r\n\r\nIt landed in M67, so it hit beta today and should hit stable in ~6 weeks. So far I haven't seen a single hit though, so either I've made a mistake, or there really isn't any usage (in dev/canary). I'm at least convinced that it should be perfectly safe to make this change, up to you if you want to wait for stable numbers.",
